# Nimbus — restore the demo data every day at 03:00 Brasília time (UTC-3, no daylight saving).
#
# Install with:  crontab -e   (as the user that owns /opt/nimbus)
#
# Ubuntu's cron uses the server time zone. Check it with `timedatectl`:
#   - server in UTC (the default on most VPS) -> use "0 6 * * *" (06:00 UTC = 03:00 BRT)
#   - server in America/Sao_Paulo             -> use "0 3 * * *"

0 6 * * * cd /opt/nimbus/back && /usr/bin/node dist/scripts/reset-demo.js >> /var/log/nimbus/reset-demo.log 2>&1
